{"type":"lesson.step","request_id":"eee3163c-f635-43f5-a856-3bc147fb3673","step":{"id":"s1","script":"A definite integral measures signed area. For a curve above the horizontal axis, it gives the ordinary area beneath the curve.","ops":[{"op":"text","id":"title","region":"A1","content":"Definite integral = signed area"},{"op":"equation","id":"function","anchor":{"el":"title","side":"below","gap":0.08},"latex":"f(x)=x^2"},{"op":"figure","id":"graph","region":"right","frame":{"x":[-0.15,2.25],"y":[-0.2,4.6],"axes":"edge","x_label":"x","y_label":"y"},"marks":[{"kind":"fn","id":"curve","y":"x^2","domain":[0,2],"label":"y = x²"}]}],"checkpoint":null}}
{"type":"lesson.step","request_id":"eee3163c-f635-43f5-a856-3bc147fb3673","step":{"id":"s2","script":"Choose the interval from zero to two. The integral represents the shaded area between the curve and the horizontal axis over this interval.","ops":[{"op":"figure","id":"shade_area","on":"graph","marks":[{"kind":"shade","id":"area","under":"curve","from":0,"to":2},{"kind":"point","id":"start","at":{"on":"curve","x":0}},{"kind":"point","id":"end","at":{"on":"curve","x":2}},{"kind":"segment","id":"boundary","from":{"at":"end"},"to":[2,0],"stroke":"dashed"},{"kind":"text","at":[1.35,0.65],"text":"area"}]},{"op":"equation","id":"integral","anchor":{"el":"function","side":"below","gap":0.1},"latex":"A=\\int_0^2 x^2\\,dx"}],"checkpoint":{"question":"What do the limits 0 and 2 tell us about the shaded area?","expected_gist":"The area extends horizontally from x = 0 to x = 2."}}}
{"type":"lesson.step","request_id":"eee3163c-f635-43f5-a856-3bc147fb3673","step":{"id":"s3","script":"An antiderivative of x squared is x cubed over three. Evaluate at two, then subtract the value at zero: eight-thirds square units.","ops":[{"op":"equation","id":"evaluation","anchor":{"el":"integral","side":"below","gap":0.1},"latex":"A=\\left[\\frac{x^3}{3}\\right]_0^2=\\frac{8}{3}-0=\\frac{8}{3}"},{"op":"figure","id":"area_note","on":"graph","marks":[{"kind":"segment","from":[0.65,2.7],"to":[1.45,1.1],"arrow":true},{"kind":"text","at":[0.65,3],"text":"positive area"}]}],"checkpoint":null}}
